<title>FRANCE: Eiffage reports 1996 H1 loss.</title>
<headline>Eiffage reports 1996 H1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		    loss   890  vs   profit 36.3</p>
<p>    Turnover				    16,687  vs	  15,726</p>
<p>NOTE - Public works group Eiffage issued its results in a statement.</p>
